  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "なみに　もまれて　まるくなった\nいろの　ついた　ガラスへん。\nすこし　ざらざら　している。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "파도에 깎여 둥글어진\n색이 있는 유리 파편.\n조금 거칠거칠하다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "受海浪沖刷而變圓的\n彩色玻璃碎片。\n表面有點粗糙。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un morceau de verre coloré arrondi par les vagues.\nSa texture est légèrement rugueuse.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein farbiges Stück Glas, das von den Wellen umspült\nund so abgeschliffen wurde. Es fühlt sich etwas rau an.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Cristal de colores pulido por la acción erosiva de las\nolas. Al tacto resulta algo áspero.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un piccolo pezzetto di vetro colorato che è stato\narrotondato dalle onde del mare. È un po’ ruvido\nal tatto.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A piece of colored glass. Waves have rounded its edges.\nIt’s slightly rough to the touch.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "波に　もまれて　丸くなった\n色のついた　ガラス片。\n少し　ざらざら　している。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "受到波浪的洗刷从而\n变成圆形的彩色玻璃片。\n表面摸起来有点粗糙不平。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Cristal de colores pulido por la acción erosiva de las\nolas. Al tacto resulta algo áspero.",
